# 9. Trend Calculation

Trend calculation happens after article analysis and embeddings.

Potential signals include:

```text
Engagement
Impact
Tone
Novelty
Coverage
Confidence
```

These signals contribute to the overall trend/signal evaluation of an article or story.

```text
Article
   ↓
Article Analysis
   ↓
Impact
Engagement
Tone
Novelty
Coverage
Confidence
   ↓
Trend Calculation
   ↓
Signal / Trend Score
```

